I added `partsBySku()` to `WorkLog`. It walks every job except those in the `dropped` state and sums `qty` per `sku`, using the sku exactly as stored. It only reads the jobs, so nothing in the log changes.

I didn't see `addPart`'s body, so I assumed it may normalise skus (via `partKey`) when storing them. Since you asked for the key exactly as stored, I used `line.sku` without any further normalisation.
